WEBVTT

01:21.350 --> 01:26.910
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.500 --> 01:29.780
[Episode 27]

01:30.710 --> 01:32.370
When a nation is about to fall,

01:33.280 --> 01:35.840
traitors like you always appear.

01:37.000 --> 01:38.759
I'm willing to risk my life

01:39.789 --> 01:41.380
to purge you rom our land.

01:44.280 --> 01:46.200
Marquis Changxing's spirit

01:46.220 --> 01:48.140
is truly formidable.

01:48.759 --> 01:49.710
But don't forget

01:50.840 --> 01:52.789
that your son is still in my hands.

01:58.000 --> 01:59.130
If you're not afraid

01:59.509 --> 02:01.760
of leaving your line without an heir,

02:02.240 --> 02:04.000
then go ahead and take my head.

02:04.030 --> 02:04.880
You!

02:15.000 --> 02:15.940
Do it.

02:22.840 --> 02:23.310
My Lord.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.710
Ye Xian suddenly fell ill.

02:24.710 --> 02:25.890
It doesn't look good.

02:25.890 --> 02:27.290
What have you done to him?

02:30.560 --> 02:31.620
Go check on him now.

02:35.440 --> 02:37.620
[Marquis of Changxing's Signed Confession]

02:45.970 --> 02:46.370
This...

02:46.370 --> 02:46.829
This...

02:51.750 --> 02:52.620
He's still breathing.

02:52.620 --> 02:53.530
Fetch a physician immediately.

02:53.530 --> 02:54.000
My Lord.

02:54.630 --> 02:56.910
Ye Xian is still Marquis Changxing's heir.

02:56.910 --> 02:57.829
If anything happens to him,

02:57.829 --> 02:59.560
I'm afraid His Majesty
will hold us accountable.

02:59.560 --> 03:00.750
The Penal Court can't shoulder this blame.

03:00.750 --> 03:02.400
Well, then report it to the court.

03:02.400 --> 03:02.910
Yes!

03:10.190 --> 03:11.520
Take the pill.

03:26.940 --> 03:27.800
I'll make sure Ye Xian

03:27.800 --> 03:28.800
takes the poison.

03:29.480 --> 03:32.000
It'll force his blood
to circulate violently

03:32.000 --> 03:33.530
and trigger a heart attack.

03:34.120 --> 03:35.050
When it happens,

03:35.620 --> 03:37.430
you go in under the excuse
of checking on him,

03:37.430 --> 03:38.890
and give him the antidote.

03:40.190 --> 03:41.710
As long as he receives it in time,

03:41.710 --> 03:43.510
it won't do much harm to his body.

03:54.910 --> 03:55.560
My Lady.

03:55.910 --> 03:56.520
My Lady.

03:56.910 --> 03:58.190
Qingpu, how is it?

04:00.470 --> 04:01.030
My Lady.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.000
Young Lord Ye...

04:04.000 --> 04:05.240
and the Marquis have both been released,

04:05.240 --> 04:07.150
and returned to the Marquis's Mansion.

04:07.150 --> 04:08.080
Thank goodness.

04:10.800 --> 04:11.430
Wait.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.660
If they're already back home,

04:13.720 --> 04:15.780
then I don't need to visit him myself.

04:17.560 --> 04:18.620
I'll ask Fifth Aunt

04:18.680 --> 04:19.940
to pass it along for me.

04:21.000 --> 04:21.529
Let's go.

04:24.680 --> 04:25.390
Ye,

04:26.120 --> 04:28.320
if you walk out of this Gu Mansion today,

04:28.360 --> 04:30.040
don't think about coming back!

04:30.040 --> 04:30.880
So be it.

04:31.000 --> 04:33.060
I don't care about this place anyway.

04:38.720 --> 04:39.560
Dismissed.

04:39.860 --> 04:41.320
Whether you like it or not,

04:41.390 --> 04:42.520
you're not leaving.

04:43.390 --> 04:44.630
Today, within this mansion,

04:44.630 --> 04:45.760
not a single person,

04:45.920 --> 04:47.390
high or low,

04:47.720 --> 04:49.120
no one can leave the mansion

04:49.120 --> 04:50.450
without my permission.

04:50.480 --> 04:51.040
You...

04:51.040 --> 04:51.840
Grandmother.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.510
You're trying this hard to stop her—

04:53.510 --> 04:54.770
does that mean you're certain

04:54.770 --> 04:56.480
that the Senior Grand Secretary
would bring down Marquis Changxing,

04:56.480 --> 04:58.000
and the Gu family'd be implicated as well?

04:58.000 --> 04:58.530
Exactly.

04:59.870 --> 05:00.560
That is a matter

05:00.560 --> 05:01.980
of life and death,

05:02.310 --> 05:03.600
so we can't afford to be careless.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.920
But have you considered what happens

05:04.920 --> 05:06.980
if the Senior Grand Secretary fails?

05:08.240 --> 05:09.720
How many military generals in Great Yan

05:09.720 --> 05:11.450
once served under the Marquis?

05:11.750 --> 05:13.070
Now that the Marquis is in trouble,

05:13.070 --> 05:14.360
we, as their relatives by marriage,

05:14.360 --> 05:15.510
are actively stopping Fifth Aunt

05:15.510 --> 05:17.040
from returning home to support her family.

05:17.040 --> 05:18.510
Forget how disgraceful it would look

05:18.510 --> 05:19.440
if word gets out.

05:19.830 --> 05:22.160
If the Marquis family
ever recovers its footing

05:22.160 --> 05:23.430
and decides to settle scores—

05:23.430 --> 05:25.000
do you really think our family's status

05:25.000 --> 05:26.190
is enough to withstand the revenge

05:26.190 --> 05:28.050
of the entire military nobility?

05:28.720 --> 05:29.650
What do you mean?

05:31.270 --> 05:32.000
Did Lord Chen

05:32.159 --> 05:33.690
tell you the Marquis family

05:34.040 --> 05:35.970
would come through this unharmed?

05:36.650 --> 05:38.580
He would never tell me such things.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.040
But if you've been reading

05:40.040 --> 05:41.920
the imperial bulletin lately, you'd know

05:41.920 --> 05:43.690
the court's peace talks
with the Nothern Barbarians

05:43.690 --> 05:45.390
have been dragging on without result.

05:45.390 --> 05:46.430
If the talks fail,

05:46.630 --> 05:47.630
there will be war.

05:48.190 --> 05:49.650
And once war breaks out...

05:51.950 --> 05:52.830
If I were you,

05:53.310 --> 05:54.970
I would simply turn a blind eye

05:55.380 --> 05:57.070
and let Fifth Aunt
come and go as she pleases.

05:57.070 --> 05:59.510
No matter what happens
to the Marquis family,

05:59.510 --> 06:00.680
if anyone questions us later,

06:00.680 --> 06:02.080
we can stand firm and say,

06:02.270 --> 06:03.800
"We're family by marriage.

06:03.830 --> 06:04.720
Who wouldn't help

06:04.720 --> 06:05.750
their own kin?"

06:08.720 --> 06:09.430
Old Madam,

06:10.120 --> 06:11.630
Marquis Changxing's Mansion men are here,

06:11.630 --> 06:12.940
saying Young Lord Ye

06:13.000 --> 06:14.630
suffered a sudden heart attack in prison,

06:14.630 --> 06:16.630
and the Marquis collapsed on the spot.

06:16.630 --> 06:18.950
They've been brought back
to the mansion for treatment.

06:18.950 --> 06:20.310
Fifth Madam is requested

06:20.310 --> 06:21.870
to go back and look after him.

06:21.870 --> 06:22.800
I'll go back right now.

06:22.800 --> 06:23.870
I'll go back right away.

06:23.870 --> 06:24.530
Fifth Aunt,

06:25.040 --> 06:26.290
you may take my carriage.

06:26.290 --> 06:27.220
I'll see you off.

06:27.430 --> 06:27.960
Let's go.

06:41.240 --> 06:42.000
Fifth Aunt.

06:43.070 --> 06:44.560
there's something I need to tell you.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.990
But you must promise me

06:46.270 --> 06:48.050
not to breathe a word of it to anyone,

06:48.050 --> 06:49.190
including the Marquis

06:49.190 --> 06:49.950
and his wife.

06:51.040 --> 06:51.800
Otherwise,

06:52.830 --> 06:55.120
the whole Marquis family
will be in danger.

06:55.120 --> 06:56.510
If it concerns the safety
of the Marquis family,

06:56.510 --> 06:57.510
I won't say a word.

06:59.070 --> 06:59.950
Actually,

07:01.190 --> 07:03.310
Ye Xian's heart attack wasn't a relapse,

07:03.310 --> 07:05.040
but was induced with medicine,

07:05.390 --> 07:06.540
intentionally.

07:07.360 --> 07:08.630
Because it was the only way

07:08.630 --> 07:10.230
to get the Marquis released.

07:11.270 --> 07:13.670
His Majesty wants
to save Marquis Changxing,

07:13.670 --> 07:15.930
but doesn't dare openly defy the mentor.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.950
And with the Marquis Changxing's temper,

07:17.950 --> 07:19.720
even under torture,

07:20.040 --> 07:21.970
he'd never yield and beg for mercy.

07:22.000 --> 07:22.830
He might even

07:25.120 --> 07:27.130
say something treacherous

07:27.800 --> 07:29.930
that would only worsen his situation.

07:30.390 --> 07:30.920
So,

07:31.430 --> 07:32.720
the only option was to rely on Ye Xian—

07:32.720 --> 07:34.510
to have him enter prison with his father.

07:34.510 --> 07:35.120
That way,

07:35.680 --> 07:37.870
Marquis Changxing would think of his son

07:37.870 --> 07:39.110
and wouldn't be so stubborn.

07:39.110 --> 07:40.440
Once Ye Xian collapsed,

07:41.360 --> 07:42.420
Marquis Changxing

07:42.580 --> 07:43.850
would have no choice but to yield,

07:43.850 --> 07:45.360
which would give His Majesty an excuse

07:45.360 --> 07:46.620
to plead on his behalf.

08:02.510 --> 08:03.390
It seems

08:03.600 --> 08:05.890
the pill prepared
by the Marquis's Mansion worked.

08:05.890 --> 08:07.220
His pulse is stable now.

08:07.510 --> 08:09.390
It's just that His Lordship's

08:09.600 --> 08:10.510
long illness,

08:10.950 --> 08:12.810
combined with his time in prison,

08:12.870 --> 08:14.940
has taken a severe toll on his body.

08:15.390 --> 08:16.510
He needs proper care.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.680
I will write a prescription.

08:17.680 --> 08:20.480
Have him take it for half a month
and see how it goes.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.570
Thank you for your trouble.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.330
This way.

08:34.000 --> 08:35.400
Thanks for your trouble.

08:40.600 --> 08:41.120
My Lady,

08:41.320 --> 08:42.720
Fifth Madam has arrived.

08:48.870 --> 08:49.530
Fifth Aunt.

08:50.150 --> 08:50.790
How is he?

08:52.000 --> 08:53.240
He's taken the medicine.

08:53.240 --> 08:54.080
The imperial physician said

08:54.080 --> 08:55.410
his pulse is stable now.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.680
That's good to hear.

09:04.790 --> 09:06.280
Xian is blessed by heaven—

09:06.360 --> 09:07.440
he made it through,

09:07.870 --> 09:09.730
and brought Father home with him.

09:10.080 --> 09:10.510
Right.

09:12.200 --> 09:14.260
Thank heavens and the bodhisattvas.

09:18.270 --> 09:20.310
Has Miss Gu left yet?

09:21.670 --> 09:23.130
She wouldn't come inside,

09:23.390 --> 09:25.120
and I didn't dare invite her in.

09:25.510 --> 09:27.330
If Xian sees her,

09:27.840 --> 09:29.600
it'll only cause another scene.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.590
Gu Jinzhao.

09:33.910 --> 09:34.950
Gu Jinzhao.

09:35.200 --> 09:35.740
Gu Jin...

09:38.120 --> 09:39.120
-Xian.
-Xian!

09:39.150 --> 09:39.720
Xian.

09:40.240 --> 09:40.990
Xian.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.770
Is Gu Jinzhao here?

09:43.360 --> 09:44.240
Where is she?

09:44.270 --> 09:45.800
You can't get out of bed yet.

09:46.000 --> 09:46.870
Where is she?

09:47.440 --> 09:48.120
Let her in.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.910
-I have something to ask her.
-Don't do this, Xian!

09:49.910 --> 09:50.360
Xian!

09:50.550 --> 09:50.960
Xian!

09:52.670 --> 09:53.620
Mother, don't stop him.

09:53.620 --> 09:54.470
Let him go.

09:54.840 --> 09:56.700
Zhao is waiting outside the door.

09:56.790 --> 09:57.510
If you don't care

09:57.510 --> 09:58.360
about this family anymore

09:58.360 --> 09:59.510
and want to piss your parents to death,

09:59.510 --> 10:00.890
then go find her!

10:02.790 --> 10:03.750
But even if you go out there—

10:03.750 --> 10:04.600
what then?

10:05.630 --> 10:07.150
Zhao would rather wait at the door

10:07.150 --> 10:08.340
than step inside.

10:08.600 --> 10:10.730
Don't you understand what that means?

10:11.630 --> 10:13.530
Even if you won't think of us,

10:13.630 --> 10:15.630
at least think of her.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.240
Xian,

10:19.510 --> 10:20.750
I'm begging you.

10:22.240 --> 10:24.500
For the sake of our old and frail parents,

10:24.790 --> 10:26.030
and me, a married daughter

10:26.030 --> 10:27.600
who's utterly powerless—

10:28.910 --> 10:31.120
please stop chasing after Zhao.

10:31.750 --> 10:32.960
Stop making a scene,

10:32.980 --> 10:33.980
will you?

10:36.750 --> 10:37.440
Xian,

10:37.910 --> 10:39.080
I'm begging you.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.620
Just listen to your sister.

10:42.320 --> 10:42.870
Our family

10:42.870 --> 10:44.630
cannot take any more of this.

10:52.240 --> 10:52.910
Xian.

10:53.030 --> 10:53.790
I know.

10:55.390 --> 10:56.320
I won't go to her.

10:59.910 --> 11:00.910
You may leave now.

11:02.960 --> 11:03.670
Leave!

12:15.270 --> 12:17.560
As soon as I heard that Ye Xian's
heart condition had relapsed

12:17.560 --> 12:19.870
and Marquis Changxing had
coughed up blood on the spot,

12:19.870 --> 12:20.790
I was so anxious

12:21.630 --> 12:23.510
that I had them both sent back

12:23.510 --> 12:25.170
to the mansion for treatment.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.390
Looking back now,

12:26.510 --> 12:27.640
it was rather hasty.

12:27.960 --> 12:29.760
I hope you can forgive me, Mr. Fu.

12:32.630 --> 12:34.030
Your Majesty overstates the matter.

12:34.030 --> 12:37.280
[Honor and Illumination]

12:35.270 --> 12:37.540
Your Majesty is kind and generous.

12:37.840 --> 12:39.510
It's truly a blessing for Great Yan.

12:39.510 --> 12:41.370
It's just that Marquis Changxing

12:41.630 --> 12:43.680
has always been arrogant

12:43.840 --> 12:44.840
and obstinate.

12:45.440 --> 12:46.200
Your Majesty

12:46.670 --> 12:48.530
alawys treats him with kindness,

12:48.910 --> 12:49.840
but he

12:51.510 --> 12:52.960
fails to appreciate it.

12:57.080 --> 12:57.880
Your Majesty,

12:58.080 --> 12:59.240
Lord Chen Yanyun

12:59.240 --> 13:00.840
is already waiting outside.

13:01.510 --> 13:02.200
Let him in.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.460
Greetings, Your Majesty.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.780
You may rise, Chen Yanyun.

13:13.360 --> 13:14.760
Thank you, Your Majesty.

13:17.360 --> 13:18.360
Grand Secretary.

13:19.000 --> 13:19.850
Chen Yanyun,

13:21.030 --> 13:22.200
I heard that

13:22.200 --> 13:24.120
while interrogating Marquis Changxing,

13:24.120 --> 13:25.780
you were nearly killed by him.

13:26.320 --> 13:27.630
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty,

13:27.630 --> 13:29.270
but I didn't suffer any losses.

13:29.270 --> 13:30.670
Ye Xian spoke insolently

13:31.270 --> 13:32.670
and openly resisted arrest.

13:32.670 --> 13:33.200
And I

13:33.790 --> 13:35.630
nearly strangled him to death.

13:36.630 --> 13:38.560
Ye Xian has always been impulsive.

13:38.600 --> 13:39.910
I've warned him so many times,

13:39.910 --> 13:41.110
yet he never listens.

13:41.270 --> 13:42.200
Both you and Ye Xian

13:42.200 --> 13:43.990
are my most trusted ministers.

13:44.010 --> 13:45.530
Why let a moment of anger

13:45.600 --> 13:47.310
escalate things this far?

13:47.550 --> 13:48.350
Your Majesty.

13:48.670 --> 13:50.510
There is a limit to what a man can endure.

13:50.510 --> 13:52.170
Ye Xian ruined the reputation

13:52.270 --> 13:53.700
of my fiancée

13:54.000 --> 13:55.750
and tried to assassinate me in the street.

13:55.750 --> 13:56.630
I cannot

13:56.630 --> 13:57.840
simply let that pass.

13:58.840 --> 14:01.100
I ask for Your Majesty's understanding.

14:09.510 --> 14:10.960
Has Marquis Changxing

14:11.360 --> 14:12.830
confessed yet?

14:15.240 --> 14:16.300
Marquis Changxing

14:16.510 --> 14:18.510
had stubbornly refused to confess.

14:18.510 --> 14:21.960
But when he heard that Ye Xian
had suffered a sudden heart attack,

14:21.960 --> 14:23.600
he coughed up blood on the spot.

14:23.600 --> 14:25.390
After receiving Your Majesty's pardon,

14:25.390 --> 14:27.510
he returned
to Marquis Changxing's Mansion to recover.

14:27.510 --> 14:28.670
From his sickbed,

14:29.200 --> 14:30.600
he wrote a memorial

14:31.960 --> 14:32.620
and asked me

14:34.320 --> 14:35.980
to present it to Your Majesty.

14:55.170 --> 14:56.220
[Ashamed to face my old friends, I beg
Your Majesty to strip me of my post]

14:56.220 --> 14:57.760
[For the sake of my humble service,
please allow my bones to return home]

15:00.270 --> 15:02.870
Marquis Changxing's requesting retirement.

15:17.670 --> 15:19.990
It seems seeing Ye Xian so gravely ill

15:20.270 --> 15:21.870
has truly broken his spirit.

15:27.200 --> 15:28.000
Your Majesty,

15:28.360 --> 15:31.260
although Marquis Changxing
has requested retirement,

15:31.260 --> 15:33.660
he hasn't formally confess to the charges.

15:35.030 --> 15:36.630
Since you and Ye Xian are at odds,

15:36.630 --> 15:37.360
then for this case,

15:37.360 --> 15:39.150
you should have recused yourself from it.

15:39.150 --> 15:39.950
Your Majesty.

15:40.910 --> 15:41.480
But...

15:44.510 --> 15:45.150
Yes.

15:47.320 --> 15:47.910
Mr. Fu,

15:49.320 --> 15:51.690
Marquis Changxing
has outstanding military achievements.

15:51.690 --> 15:52.870
When Prince Ruichang rebelled,

15:52.870 --> 15:54.390
he risked his life to defend the throne.

15:54.390 --> 15:56.270
He has made great contributions
to Great Yan.

15:56.270 --> 15:58.360
Perhaps, we can spare him this time?

16:04.270 --> 16:07.320
Since Your Majesty pleads
on Marquis Changxing's behalf,

16:07.320 --> 16:09.550
I shall obey the decree.

16:10.630 --> 16:12.890
However, the laws of the nation is clear.

16:13.290 --> 16:14.270
We cannot

16:15.270 --> 16:16.630
treat them too lightly.

16:24.120 --> 16:25.000
Lord Chen,

16:26.320 --> 16:27.510
when the imperial physician returned

16:27.510 --> 16:29.270
from the mansion, what did he say?

16:29.270 --> 16:30.270
Grand Secretary,

16:30.910 --> 16:32.390
during the previous palace coup,

16:32.390 --> 16:33.450
Marquis Changxing

16:34.030 --> 16:35.490
suffered severe injuries

16:35.630 --> 16:37.160
and never fully recovered.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.390
Now, after with

16:38.550 --> 16:40.610
Young Lord Ye's sudden heart attack,

16:40.750 --> 16:42.350
he coughed blood on the spot.

16:42.510 --> 16:44.150
His condition has worsened even more.

16:44.150 --> 16:45.750
The physician's assessment

16:47.200 --> 16:49.260
was that the damage is irreversible.

16:50.750 --> 16:53.270
Irreversible?

17:05.410 --> 17:06.450
In that case,

17:06.760 --> 17:09.099
we shall spare Marquis Changxing.

17:10.240 --> 17:12.170
Mr. Fu, you're truly magnanimous!

17:12.200 --> 17:13.200
Issue the decree.

17:13.550 --> 17:17.160
Considering Marquis Changxing's
past campaigns for the nation,

17:17.160 --> 17:18.680
and his role in suppressing
the northern barbarians,

17:18.680 --> 17:20.240
his contribution to the nation shall

17:20.240 --> 17:22.440
offset his offense against the throne.

17:22.790 --> 17:24.240
I hope that the father and son

17:24.240 --> 17:25.829
will live up to my expectations

17:25.829 --> 17:27.290
and make no more mistakes.

17:28.349 --> 17:30.110
I hear and obey.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.050
If Your Majesty wants

17:35.050 --> 17:36.910
to save Marquis Changxing's life

17:37.460 --> 17:39.210
and his reputation,

17:39.440 --> 17:41.300
then forgive me, I cannot do that.

17:41.790 --> 17:42.350
But...

17:43.000 --> 17:44.600
if Your Majesty merely wants

17:44.750 --> 17:47.080
to save Marquis Changxing's reputation,

17:47.110 --> 17:48.710
then there may still be a way.

17:48.750 --> 17:49.310
It may be

17:49.960 --> 17:50.760
worth trying.

17:51.440 --> 17:52.220
What is it?

17:53.000 --> 17:54.330
Make Marquis Changxing

17:55.000 --> 17:56.330
understand the stakes.

17:56.880 --> 17:58.410
Make him bow his head first,

17:58.510 --> 17:59.030
and

17:59.920 --> 18:01.000
it must be genuine.

18:05.030 --> 18:05.960
Bow his head?

18:07.830 --> 18:09.490
Let alone Marquis Changxing,

18:10.270 --> 18:11.400
even I, the Emperor,

18:11.960 --> 18:13.490
must sometimes do the same.

18:17.390 --> 18:21.450
[Ji family's Silk Store]

18:19.240 --> 18:19.920
His Majesty

18:20.270 --> 18:22.030
has pardoned Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

18:22.030 --> 18:23.240
So the Marquis Changxing

18:23.240 --> 18:24.770
and his family are safe now?

18:25.160 --> 18:25.750
Yes.

18:26.680 --> 18:27.480
That's great.

18:28.110 --> 18:29.570
What a relief.

18:30.510 --> 18:32.400
I want to thank you on Ye Xian's behalf.

18:32.400 --> 18:33.880
There's no need to thank me.

18:33.880 --> 18:35.960
Marquis Changxing
dedicated his life to military service

18:35.960 --> 18:37.720
and made contributions to the country.

18:37.720 --> 18:39.160
Even if His Majesty had said nothing,

18:39.160 --> 18:41.090
I would have found a way to save him.

18:41.350 --> 18:42.070
Right now,

18:42.550 --> 18:43.510
the peace talks
with the Northern barbarians

18:43.510 --> 18:44.770
are still unresolved.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.400
If the northern side were to learn

18:46.400 --> 18:47.640
that Marquis Changxing

18:47.640 --> 18:49.400
had been imprisoned and gravely ill—

18:49.400 --> 18:51.240
they might start the war again.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.270
My mentor considered this as well.

18:53.270 --> 18:54.550
He was afraid that Marquis Changxing

18:54.550 --> 18:55.740
would suddenly pass away

18:55.740 --> 18:57.270
before the peace talks concluded,

18:57.270 --> 18:59.330
so he decided to let him off this time.

19:00.070 --> 19:01.420
Then how serious

19:01.760 --> 19:03.760
is Marquis Changxing's condition?

19:04.400 --> 19:06.130
He doesn't have much time left.

19:06.510 --> 19:08.590
I've managed to protect his reputation,

19:08.590 --> 19:10.510
but Marquis Changxing family's prestige,

19:10.510 --> 19:11.730
built over decades,

19:11.960 --> 19:13.360
is difficult to sustain.

19:24.070 --> 19:24.790
That year,

19:26.920 --> 19:29.120
when I had become my mentor's disciple,

19:29.350 --> 19:30.720
the Yellow River flooded,

19:30.720 --> 19:33.640
and my mentor didn't sleep
for three days and nights.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.420
His mouth

19:34.720 --> 19:35.920
was full of blisters.

19:36.500 --> 19:39.110
I was by his side,
attending to his writing needs.

19:39.110 --> 19:41.270
I told him
he was pushing himself too hard,

19:41.270 --> 19:41.960
and he said,

19:43.290 --> 19:44.540
"Our suffering

19:44.790 --> 19:45.990
will eventually end,

19:46.720 --> 19:48.830
but the suffering of the common people

19:48.830 --> 19:50.110
never does."

19:53.310 --> 19:54.370
But what about now?

19:55.310 --> 19:56.510
From the palace coup,

19:57.270 --> 19:59.870
to replacing disaster relief grain
with bran,

20:00.240 --> 20:03.100
to what happened
with Marquis Changxing's family—

20:03.680 --> 20:04.810
I'm afraid my mentor

20:06.720 --> 20:09.050
has already lost his original intention.

20:22.810 --> 20:23.870
I remember

20:24.880 --> 20:26.000
when I was seven,

20:27.310 --> 20:29.110
after the great victory at Hulan Pass,

20:29.110 --> 20:30.170
Marquis Changxing

20:30.400 --> 20:32.030
watered his horse by the Wuliang River

20:32.030 --> 20:33.110
and composed a poem

20:34.310 --> 20:35.770
that became widely known:

20:38.160 --> 20:40.670
"Becoming a lord is not my desire,

20:41.880 --> 20:44.510
I only wish for everlasting peace."

20:52.880 --> 20:54.830
Becoming a lord is not my desire,

20:55.640 --> 20:59.880
I only wish for everlasting peace."

21:02.000 --> 21:02.880
You are right.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.790
Why aren't you eating?

22:00.720 --> 22:02.320
Even if you have no appetite,

22:02.510 --> 22:03.910
at least drink some soup.

22:05.030 --> 22:05.750
I can't.

22:07.750 --> 22:08.750
You can't keep

22:08.750 --> 22:10.480
ruining your health like this.

22:10.790 --> 22:11.800
If you collapse,

22:12.000 --> 22:12.960
what am I supposed to do?

22:12.960 --> 22:15.020
What are your parents supposed to do?

22:22.030 --> 22:22.890
Your Lordship,

22:23.000 --> 22:25.110
Miss Xue sent someone over with gifts.

22:25.110 --> 22:25.920
Miss Xue?

22:26.510 --> 22:27.000
Who?

22:29.720 --> 22:30.440
Xue Qinglan?

22:30.440 --> 22:31.160
Exactly.

22:32.510 --> 22:33.370
Throw them out.

22:33.880 --> 22:34.740
Your Lordship,

22:35.110 --> 22:36.750
there's ten-year-old ginseng

22:36.750 --> 22:38.030
and the finest borneol among them.

22:38.030 --> 22:38.700
Throw them out!

22:38.700 --> 22:39.430
Understood.

22:53.340 --> 22:56.150
[House of Virtue and Brilliance]

22:55.440 --> 22:58.070
108 bolts of Yunjin brocade;

22:58.790 --> 23:01.440
18 pairs of layered filigree

23:01.440 --> 23:02.570
gold ruyi hairpins;

23:02.570 --> 23:04.080
[66,600 taels of fine silver]

23:03.400 --> 23:04.800
and the wedding money...

23:05.830 --> 23:07.960
Why are there so many betrothal gifts?

23:09.160 --> 23:11.290
Third Brother adores his future wife.

23:11.350 --> 23:12.790
I showed him the draft

23:12.140 --> 23:15.320
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

23:12.790 --> 23:13.960
of the betrothal gift list,

23:13.960 --> 23:15.760
and he added more items himself—

23:16.110 --> 23:18.400
all from his own savings,

23:18.590 --> 23:20.240
not the common fund.

23:21.110 --> 23:22.840
So I couldn't say much about it.

23:24.200 --> 23:25.720
He's practically giving away

23:25.720 --> 23:26.850
his entire fortune.

23:28.830 --> 23:30.880
The wedding is set on the 16th
of the second lunar month.

23:30.880 --> 23:32.510
The Gu family sent word earlier

23:32.510 --> 23:34.750
that they will formally
add to the dowry the day after tomorrow.

23:34.750 --> 23:36.680
I didn't dare neglect the matter,

23:37.240 --> 23:39.510
so I picked a pair
of filigree gold hairpins

23:39.510 --> 23:40.550
and a pair of jade bracelets.

23:40.550 --> 23:42.610
I'll have Sixth Sister deliver them.

23:43.270 --> 23:44.070
Mother,

23:44.830 --> 23:45.590
will you

23:45.920 --> 23:47.350
also...

23:48.590 --> 23:51.590
Adding to the dowry
is the bride's family's business.

23:51.830 --> 23:52.880
Zhao

23:53.240 --> 23:54.560
is my sister's

23:54.590 --> 23:55.830
most beloved child.

23:55.960 --> 23:57.940
The Ji family will certainly be generous

23:57.940 --> 23:59.400
with the dowry additions.

23:59.830 --> 24:02.030
There is no need for me to join the crowd.

24:03.440 --> 24:04.270
Yes.

24:05.680 --> 24:06.400
Never mind.

24:08.030 --> 24:10.680
I do have a white jade ruyi here.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.200
Take it with you,

24:12.400 --> 24:13.730
and have Ying deliver it

24:14.070 --> 24:15.440
along with the rest.

24:17.880 --> 24:19.070
Sure thing,

24:19.070 --> 24:20.350
my dear mother,

24:20.550 --> 24:23.000
I knew you were the most generous of all.

24:24.240 --> 24:24.840
By the way.

24:25.400 --> 24:27.310
Second Master sent a letter yesterday,

24:27.310 --> 24:28.400
saying he will come

24:28.440 --> 24:30.440
for Third Brother's wedding banquet.

24:30.440 --> 24:32.200
He should be leaving soon.

24:33.030 --> 24:35.160
I've also sent a letter to Xuanqing,

24:35.160 --> 24:37.420
asking him to return as soon as possible.

24:40.480 --> 24:41.750
What's wrong, Mother?

24:42.310 --> 24:44.370
She’s about to marry into the family,

24:44.590 --> 24:45.960
and you still haven't

24:46.030 --> 24:47.270
gotten over it?

24:47.650 --> 24:49.590
You saw right through me.

24:51.200 --> 24:52.720
To be honest,

24:54.510 --> 24:56.750
I'm truly unhappy about it.

24:57.830 --> 24:59.160
Mother,

24:59.550 --> 25:02.550
Third Brother has risen rapidly
these past few years,

25:02.590 --> 25:04.160
holding high positions and great power.

25:04.160 --> 25:05.030
At court,

25:05.030 --> 25:06.740
he's used to having the final say.

25:06.740 --> 25:10.520
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

25:07.440 --> 25:08.510
So when he returns home,

25:08.510 --> 25:10.680
he naturally isn't accustomed
to being told what to do.

25:10.680 --> 25:12.000
Besides,

25:12.720 --> 25:13.960
Old Madam Ji

25:14.240 --> 25:16.500
also just found out about it, didn't she?

25:17.310 --> 25:19.110
But to put it bluntly,

25:19.790 --> 25:21.520
there's indeed some suspicion

25:21.790 --> 25:23.350
that he and Miss Gu

25:24.590 --> 25:26.830
were privately involved
before the engagement.

25:26.830 --> 25:29.510
You call that merely a suspicion?

25:35.520 --> 25:40.560
[Thrice Reflections Against Greed;
Ninefold Virtues in the Sound of the Qin]

25:36.160 --> 25:37.310
Send this over for her dowry ceremony

25:37.310 --> 25:38.640
the day after tomorrow.

25:45.830 --> 25:47.070
I was taking a nap,

25:47.240 --> 25:48.830
and you called me over so urgently

25:48.830 --> 25:50.360
just to deliver something?

25:50.440 --> 25:51.200
Besides,

25:51.350 --> 25:53.110
Jinzhao is already so wealthy.

25:53.240 --> 25:53.790
Does she really need you

25:53.790 --> 25:55.000
to add to her dowry?

25:55.510 --> 25:57.790
Whether she's rich or not is her business.

25:57.790 --> 25:59.800
Adding to her dowry is simply my gesture.

25:59.800 --> 26:01.330
Hurry and deliver it for me.

26:06.270 --> 26:07.240
Don't worry.

26:09.590 --> 26:10.110
Look.

26:10.830 --> 26:12.110
This one is for you.

26:16.550 --> 26:17.440
Do you like it?

26:21.510 --> 26:22.070
Alright.

26:22.200 --> 26:23.640
I'll deliver it for you.

26:43.000 --> 26:43.640
Your ink bamboo painting

26:43.640 --> 26:45.110
is getting better and better.

26:45.110 --> 26:46.000
At first glance,

26:46.000 --> 26:48.260
I thought it was painted by Third Master.

26:51.440 --> 26:53.680
Third Uncle's ink bamboo has

26:53.960 --> 26:55.240
such elegance and depth.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.550
How could I possibly compare to him?

26:56.550 --> 26:57.810
You're far too modest.

26:58.110 --> 26:59.720
Third Master is indeed exceptional,

26:59.720 --> 27:01.920
but you also passed the exam as a Tanhua.

27:01.960 --> 27:02.920
You aren't

27:03.110 --> 27:04.240
far behind him.

27:04.550 --> 27:05.010
Go away.

27:05.880 --> 27:07.680
All you know is how to flatter me.

27:11.350 --> 27:13.210
My Lord, there's a letter for you.

27:29.240 --> 27:30.750
It's from my youngest aunt.

27:30.750 --> 27:34.150
She probably wants to know
when you'll arrive in the capital.

27:42.650 --> 27:44.480
[Gu Mansion]

27:48.140 --> 27:50.130
[Gu]

27:49.030 --> 27:50.690
These are all for Miss Gu's dowry.

27:50.690 --> 27:52.090
Not just the Ji family...

27:52.880 --> 27:53.510
Welcome, Madam Liu.

27:53.510 --> 27:54.680
and the Chen family too.

27:54.680 --> 27:56.000
They said after Old Madam
saw

27:56.000 --> 27:57.070
the Chen family's list of betrothal gifts,

27:57.070 --> 27:58.310
she immediately had an empty storeroom

27:58.310 --> 27:59.200
cleared out to place the gifts.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.130
Welcome, Madam Wang.

27:59.660 --> 28:02.510
[Gu]

28:12.350 --> 28:13.160
Zhao.

28:14.000 --> 28:16.490
Lian caught a cold last night.

28:16.790 --> 28:17.440
Early this morning,

28:17.440 --> 28:19.240
a physician wrote a prescription for her,

28:19.240 --> 28:20.760
so I told her not to come,

28:20.830 --> 28:22.490
in case she passed it on to you.

28:24.030 --> 28:24.920
This

28:26.720 --> 28:28.400
is her gift for your dowry.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.240
And these

28:32.640 --> 28:34.790
are from me.

28:35.030 --> 28:36.760
I only wish that, in the future,

28:36.790 --> 28:39.310
everything will go exactly as you wish.

28:40.200 --> 28:41.530
Thank you, Second Aunt.

28:50.110 --> 28:51.550
My Lady, Mrs. Mu is here.

28:53.000 --> 28:53.720
I see.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.790
Which Mrs. Mu?

28:57.640 --> 28:59.200
The wife of Lord Mu Shi'an.

29:01.030 --> 29:03.920
The newly appointed
Vice Minister of Personnel?

29:05.310 --> 29:07.270
Your Second Uncle didn't get the post,

29:07.270 --> 29:08.830
and neither did Yao Ping,

29:09.160 --> 29:11.160
yet he ended up benefiting instead.

29:12.310 --> 29:14.640
I'll go with you to take a look.

29:15.960 --> 29:16.640
After you.

29:23.590 --> 29:24.790
Greetings, Mrs. Mu.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.410
My Master

29:27.480 --> 29:29.810
has been friends with Lord Chen for years.

29:29.920 --> 29:30.590
This time,

29:30.750 --> 29:32.510
when we heard about this splendid match,

29:32.510 --> 29:34.570
we were both truly delighted for him.

29:34.790 --> 29:36.720
Look at this beautiful face.

29:34.920 --> 29:37.700
[Mrs. Mu, Mu Shian's wife]

29:37.200 --> 29:39.530
You and Lord Chen

29:39.750 --> 29:41.550
are truly a match made in heaven.

29:41.640 --> 29:43.300
You're being so kind, Mrs. Mu.

29:46.960 --> 29:47.960
Lan, you're here.

29:48.270 --> 29:48.880
Mrs. Mu,

29:48.900 --> 29:50.660
this is my third sister, Lan.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.030
This is Mrs. Mu.

29:54.400 --> 29:56.260
Greetings, Second Aunt and Zhao.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.770
Greetings, Mrs. Mu.

30:00.790 --> 30:01.880
So you are Lan.

30:02.790 --> 30:03.400
Yes.

30:07.400 --> 30:08.030
Zhao,

30:08.310 --> 30:08.920
I didn't have

30:08.920 --> 30:10.310
anything worthy of giving,

30:10.310 --> 30:12.020
so I sewed a wedding quilt

30:12.110 --> 30:13.340
for you.

30:13.590 --> 30:14.750
Something made with your own hands

30:14.750 --> 30:16.610
is worth more than gold or silver.

30:17.590 --> 30:18.510
The embroidery

30:18.720 --> 30:20.350
is really something!

30:20.640 --> 30:22.500
Did you embroider this yourself?

30:22.550 --> 30:23.200
Yes.

30:24.510 --> 30:26.960
What a wonderful needlework!

30:30.070 --> 30:32.310
I'll pack the wedding quilt
into the chest.

30:32.310 --> 30:32.790
Okay.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.270
Miss Gu,

30:35.720 --> 30:37.980
the Sixth Miss of the Chen family is here.

30:39.550 --> 30:41.880
Someone from the Chen family came as well?

30:42.590 --> 30:43.720
I'll go welcome her.

30:51.350 --> 30:52.200
Yanying,

30:52.250 --> 30:52.930
I thought

30:52.960 --> 30:54.420
you weren't coming today.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.640
I didn't want to come.

30:56.160 --> 30:58.000
But someone was worried
you'd feel slighted,

30:58.000 --> 30:58.870
so he insisted I come over

30:58.870 --> 31:00.400
to deliver gifts for your dowry day.

31:00.400 --> 31:02.330
My dear sister, it's my fault.

31:02.720 --> 31:03.880
I shouldn't have kept it from you.

31:03.880 --> 31:05.110
Since you know you were wrong,

31:05.110 --> 31:06.030
let me ask you something.

31:06.030 --> 31:07.030
At your coming-of-age ceremony,

31:07.030 --> 31:08.230
Yanyun was there too.

31:08.400 --> 31:09.110
Was that when the two of you

31:09.110 --> 31:10.400
start seeing each other?

31:10.400 --> 31:11.440
Of course not.

31:11.960 --> 31:13.960
What about the Mid-Autumn Festival

31:14.000 --> 31:16.060
when we admired the chrysanthemums?

31:16.110 --> 31:17.680
I don't think so.

31:18.750 --> 31:20.030
Then when was it?

31:20.750 --> 31:23.950
It couldn't possibly be
during the Spring Outing, right?

31:26.000 --> 31:26.790
Wait, I know!

31:27.070 --> 31:28.180
Was it in Tongzhou?

31:28.400 --> 31:29.640
I remember two years ago,

31:29.640 --> 31:31.200
Yanyun was in Tongzhou for a long time.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.600
Were you in Tongzhou too?

31:34.590 --> 31:35.590
Come with me.

31:41.310 --> 31:42.750
I'm not done asking questions yet.

31:42.750 --> 31:44.350
Don't think you can bribe me.

31:49.880 --> 31:50.720
These were carved

31:50.720 --> 31:52.350
by the best craftsman in Jiangnan.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.550
There are 12 in total.

31:53.640 --> 31:55.400
Each one has a different shape.

31:56.510 --> 31:58.010
What are you doing?

31:58.200 --> 31:59.200
As long as you promise me

31:59.200 --> 32:00.720
not to ask any more questions,

32:00.720 --> 32:01.730
and I'll give you

32:01.790 --> 32:02.720
all of these.

32:06.550 --> 32:07.920
How could you do this?

32:09.350 --> 32:10.440
There's also a set of eight

32:10.440 --> 32:11.350
jade puppies.

32:16.000 --> 32:16.920
I came here to deliver gifts

32:16.920 --> 32:18.070
for your dowry.

32:18.160 --> 32:18.880
Why are you giving me

32:18.880 --> 32:20.240
gifts instead?

32:21.680 --> 32:23.440
And there are also four little jade boys.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.960
If you wind up the mechanism,

32:24.960 --> 32:26.220
they can even do flips.

32:28.200 --> 32:29.070
Greetings, Third Sister-in-law!

32:29.070 --> 32:30.590
I suddenly don't want to ask anything.

32:30.590 --> 32:32.520
As long as you and Yanyun are happy.

32:38.440 --> 32:39.350
Miss Yu is here.

32:43.050 --> 32:51.550
[Generations of Excellence]

32:46.160 --> 32:47.030
Wanxue.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.600
What took you so long?

32:51.640 --> 32:53.300
The banquet is about to start.

32:53.480 --> 32:54.880
I had no choice.

32:54.880 --> 32:56.340
I was going to leave early,

32:56.480 --> 32:58.110
but my stepmother suddenly said
she had a headache.

32:58.110 --> 32:59.570
I almost couldn't leave.

32:59.680 --> 33:01.880
Luckily, Father came and helped me out.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.590
I don't have anything especially fine

33:03.590 --> 33:04.590
to give you, Zhao.

33:06.030 --> 33:08.560
This box contains
the latest eyebrow powder.

33:09.270 --> 33:10.310
And this

33:10.310 --> 33:11.110
is the scented powder I made myself—

33:11.110 --> 33:13.350
it's better than what you can buy outside.

33:13.350 --> 33:14.790
And here is a box of silver ingots

33:14.790 --> 33:16.790
for you to reward the servants with.

33:17.000 --> 33:18.480
They're all great and very useful.

33:18.480 --> 33:19.350
I like them all.

33:20.720 --> 33:21.510
Hold on.

33:21.720 --> 33:23.400
You're engaged to Xuanqing now.

33:23.400 --> 33:24.310
You shouldn't call her Zhao anymore,

33:24.310 --> 33:26.170
instead you should call her Aunt,

33:26.200 --> 33:27.550
And you shouldn't call her Wanxue either—

33:27.550 --> 33:29.480
you should call her Niece-in-law.

33:30.440 --> 33:32.590
I thought about it all night yesterday,

33:32.590 --> 33:34.440
whether I should call you Zhao

33:34.510 --> 33:35.550
or Aunt.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.440
But in the end,

33:36.550 --> 33:37.880
I still called you Zhao.

33:38.070 --> 33:40.450
I really couldn't call you Aunt.

33:42.030 --> 33:43.390
Just call me Zhao.

33:43.640 --> 33:45.310
Don't worry about the seniority.

33:45.310 --> 33:47.000
You two might be willing
to keep it that way,

33:47.000 --> 33:48.070
but I'm certainly not.

33:48.070 --> 33:49.510
Come here, my dear niece-in-law.

33:49.510 --> 33:51.170
Give your Aunt a shoulder rub.

33:51.480 --> 33:53.640
Give you an inch and you take a mile!

33:53.790 --> 33:54.960
I'm not talking to you.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.490
I'm going to put these away.

34:02.310 --> 34:03.680
She's shy.

34:03.960 --> 34:04.750
Look at you.

34:04.750 --> 34:06.160
I'm not talking to you either.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.310
I'll go prepare the banquet.

34:07.310 --> 34:08.110
Are you coming with me?

34:08.110 --> 34:12.780
[Generations of Excellence]

34:08.920 --> 34:09.449
Let's go.

34:26.880 --> 34:28.540
Just place it behind that box.

34:39.710 --> 34:40.280
My Lady.

34:40.840 --> 34:42.300
Since Miss Ying is also here today,

34:42.300 --> 34:43.670
why don't you ask her

34:43.840 --> 34:45.710
about your marriage to Young Master Chen

34:45.710 --> 34:48.239
and what exactly
the Chen family is planning?

34:49.110 --> 34:50.239
How could I possibly

34:50.440 --> 34:51.710
be the one to ask?

34:51.920 --> 34:52.760
But, My Lady,

34:52.960 --> 34:54.000
the Chen family scheduled the wedding

34:54.000 --> 34:55.340
for the end of last year.

34:55.400 --> 34:56.510
Then, out of nowhere, Young Master Chen

34:56.510 --> 34:57.400
suddenly went to Shanxi for peace talks

34:57.400 --> 34:58.800
with the northern barbarians.

34:58.800 --> 35:00.110
Forgive me for speaking bluntly,

35:00.110 --> 35:00.800
since he already
had a marriage arrangement,

35:00.800 --> 35:02.110
why would he accept such an assignment?

35:02.110 --> 35:03.170
If it were anyone else,

35:03.170 --> 35:04.150
naturally they couldn't refuse

35:04.150 --> 35:05.320
an order from the Imperial Court.

35:05.320 --> 35:06.000
But Young Master Chen

35:06.000 --> 35:07.280
is Lord Chen's own nephew—

35:07.280 --> 35:07.920
going or staying

35:07.920 --> 35:08.590
was entirely up to one word

35:08.590 --> 35:10.030
-from Lord Chen.
-Enough.

35:10.030 --> 35:11.710
I've clearly spoiled you too much.

35:11.710 --> 35:13.970
You're speaking completely out of line.

35:16.010 --> 35:22.330
[Chen Mansion]

35:48.290 --> 35:52.330
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

35:49.190 --> 35:50.080
Mother.

35:50.150 --> 35:51.070
Xuanqing

35:51.150 --> 35:53.110
has truly grown into a fine,

35:53.230 --> 35:54.360
accomplished man.

35:55.800 --> 35:56.760
Honestly,

35:56.760 --> 35:58.400
the mansion feels so empty without you

35:58.400 --> 36:00.460
around to liven things up.

36:03.440 --> 36:04.360
Xuanqing.

36:05.000 --> 36:05.760
Xuanqing?

36:08.840 --> 36:09.960
Xuanqing.

36:13.070 --> 36:13.800
Second Aunt.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.970
I was distracted just now.

36:16.030 --> 36:17.030
What were you saying?

36:16.960 --> 36:21.890
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

36:17.590 --> 36:19.510
Oh, nothing much.

36:19.920 --> 36:20.670
I was just saying

36:20.670 --> 36:22.670
you've truly become an accomplished man.

36:22.670 --> 36:24.410
When I walked in just now

36:24.440 --> 36:25.880
and saw you sitting there,

36:25.880 --> 36:27.070
for a moment

36:27.190 --> 36:27.760
I thought

36:27.760 --> 36:29.640
I was looking at your Third Uncle.

36:31.360 --> 36:33.570
It's a long and exhausting journey

36:33.630 --> 36:35.320
back from Shanxi.

36:35.440 --> 36:37.020
You must be very tired.

36:37.070 --> 36:39.110
Hurry back and get some rest.

36:45.150 --> 36:46.550
Thank you, Grandmother.

36:47.440 --> 36:49.500
I have something to discuss with you.

36:49.630 --> 36:51.320
I've been in Shanxi for half a year,

36:51.320 --> 36:53.580
and there is still much unfinished work.

36:53.920 --> 36:55.000
I was thinking

36:55.280 --> 36:57.030
of moving into the Hanlin Academy
quarters tomorrow,

36:57.030 --> 36:59.230
and returning after the offices close.

36:59.550 --> 37:01.800
How busy can the Hanlin Academy be?

37:02.320 --> 37:03.150
Don't carry

37:03.150 --> 37:05.480
the weight of the world on your shoulders.

37:05.510 --> 37:08.310
Rest for a few days

37:08.440 --> 37:10.640
before taking on your next assignment.

37:11.630 --> 37:12.630
Besides,

37:13.500 --> 37:14.630
in a few days,

37:15.070 --> 37:17.510
your Third Uncle is getting married.

37:18.190 --> 37:19.960
You can return to work

37:20.000 --> 37:22.280
after attending the wedding banquet.

37:22.570 --> 37:25.130
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

37:23.230 --> 37:23.810
Right,

37:24.150 --> 37:25.880
don't forget about the Yu family.

37:25.880 --> 37:27.280
Now that you're back,

37:27.590 --> 37:29.000
remember to

37:29.230 --> 37:31.670
visit your future in-laws early,

37:32.280 --> 37:34.230
so they won't find fault with you.

37:39.170 --> 37:40.840
Yes, Grandmother.

38:07.660 --> 38:09.250
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

38:10.050 --> 38:12.920
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

38:15.440 --> 38:16.560
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

38:17.470 --> 38:20.220
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

38:22.940 --> 38:24.410
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

38:25.410 --> 38:30.130
[Shunning the World, Returning to Nature]

38:25.630 --> 38:28.650
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

38:29.730 --> 38:35.990
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart♪

38:36.780 --> 38:39.690
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

38:40.640 --> 38:43.370
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

38:44.400 --> 38:47.400
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

38:48.240 --> 38:50.650
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

38:48.670 --> 38:49.360
Now you know

38:49.360 --> 38:50.560
the so-called truth.

38:51.940 --> 38:53.330
Whether to get married to the Yu family

38:52.290 --> 38:55.210
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

38:54.360 --> 38:54.960
and try to keep this secret

38:54.960 --> 38:56.050
as tightly as possible,

38:56.050 --> 38:59.130
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

38:57.550 --> 38:58.950
or to give up the marriage

38:59.890 --> 39:07.140
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

39:00.400 --> 39:02.070
and prepare to face everything

39:02.070 --> 39:03.870
after you pass the examination—

39:04.620 --> 39:05.750
the choice is yours.

39:24.850 --> 39:26.460
♪ We once drank to talk of love and hate ♪

39:27.750 --> 39:30.130
♪ But we fell into
the deep ditch of rumors ♪

39:33.070 --> 39:34.200
♪ Meeting and parting were like
moves on a chessboard ♪

39:34.860 --> 39:37.860
♪ Every heartfelt word ended as a fault ♪

39:40.400 --> 39:41.910
♪ Seen the sun rise and the moon set ♪

39:43.150 --> 39:45.640
♪ Only sigh that we are no longer
on the same path ♪

39:46.950 --> 39:53.640
♪ One wrong choice drove
my old friend away like a drifting bird ♪

39:54.260 --> 39:57.350
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

39:58.100 --> 40:00.590
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

40:01.840 --> 40:04.870
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

40:05.840 --> 40:08.260
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

40:09.770 --> 40:12.840
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

40:10.670 --> 40:11.280
Yunting.

40:13.770 --> 40:16.500
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

40:17.660 --> 40:24.590
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

40:18.670 --> 40:19.950
Deliver this letter

40:20.030 --> 40:21.280
to Miss Gu for me.

40:22.280 --> 40:23.610
This is inappropriate!

40:23.910 --> 40:25.680
I just want to see her.

40:26.670 --> 40:28.590
What's inappropriate about that?

40:28.590 --> 40:29.720
I just want to ask her

40:30.230 --> 40:32.030
why she agreed to this marriage.

40:32.150 --> 40:34.000
Does she have some hidden troubles?

40:34.000 --> 40:35.960
Young Master, it's really inappropriate!

40:35.960 --> 40:37.690
What if Third Master finds out?

40:40.750 --> 40:43.620
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

40:42.000 --> 40:43.000
If you are afraid,

40:43.150 --> 40:44.150
I will deliver it myself.

40:44.150 --> 40:44.920
No, no!

40:44.450 --> 40:46.570
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

40:45.880 --> 40:46.680
Please don't.

40:48.110 --> 40:48.880
Fine.

40:48.570 --> 40:51.290
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

40:49.550 --> 40:50.810
I'll go deliver it now.

40:52.410 --> 40:55.070
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

40:56.230 --> 40:56.710
Go now.

40:56.800 --> 40:59.310
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

41:00.060 --> 41:03.090
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

41:03.980 --> 41:09.930
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

41:11.870 --> 41:17.630
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

41:13.710 --> 41:14.230
My Lady.

41:16.710 --> 41:17.510
This is the dowry gift

41:17.510 --> 41:18.500
from Madam.

41:18.710 --> 41:19.510
Madam said

41:19.510 --> 41:20.030
she has been staying at the mansion

41:20.030 --> 41:21.920
taking care of the Marquis these days.

41:21.920 --> 41:23.150
She can't get the medicine smell off her,

41:23.150 --> 41:24.300
so she won't come personally

41:24.300 --> 41:25.500
to congratulate you.

41:26.030 --> 41:27.760
Please give Fifth Aunt my thanks,

41:27.760 --> 41:29.690
and send my regards to the Marquis.

41:30.150 --> 41:31.210
Thank you, My Lady.

41:40.590 --> 41:41.150
My Lady.

41:44.230 --> 41:44.840
This...

41:47.710 --> 41:48.770
Whose letter is it?

41:53.710 --> 41:55.800
It's from Young Master Chen's servant,

41:55.430 --> 41:56.880
[Respectfully Presented to Jinzhao]

41:55.800 --> 41:56.800
Yunting.

41:58.150 --> 41:59.150
He also said

41:59.510 --> 42:00.670
that Young Master Chen,

42:00.670 --> 42:02.070
has lost his appetite for days,

42:02.070 --> 42:03.930
because you are getting married.

42:06.730 --> 42:08.120
[Respectfully Presented to Jinzhao]

42:08.880 --> 42:09.670
My Lady, aren't you going to read

42:09.670 --> 42:10.630
what's written inside?

42:10.630 --> 42:11.190
No need.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.510
Even if I read it,

42:12.510 --> 42:14.150
there's nothing I can do for him.

42:14.150 --> 42:15.630
It would only upset me.

42:16.710 --> 42:17.400
Indeed.

42:18.340 --> 42:22.620
[Respectfully Presented to Jinzhao]

42:19.110 --> 42:20.070
It was clearly Young Master Chen

42:20.070 --> 42:21.510
who broke his promise first,

42:21.510 --> 42:22.360
yet now he acts

42:23.510 --> 42:25.240
as if he's the heartbroken one.

42:27.800 --> 42:28.400
By the way,

42:28.590 --> 42:29.960
if Yunting hasn't gone far yet,

42:29.960 --> 42:30.710
catch up to him

42:30.710 --> 42:32.240
and pass on a message for me.

42:32.480 --> 42:34.150
Tell him to inform his master

42:34.280 --> 42:36.280
to eat well and take care of himself.

42:37.150 --> 42:38.550
I moved on a long time ago,

42:38.550 --> 42:39.950
and he should do the same.

42:46.060 --> 42:48.420
[Respectfully Presented to Jinzhao]

43:02.440 --> 43:06.230
[A Splendid Match]
